#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0243 expect=noViolation domain=ADSL
#note "Load-bearing var_exists(\"TRTxxAN\") pin: TRT01AN, the operator's KEY, is absent. TRTxxA seeds tuple xx=01 and TRTxxAN is synthesised as the absent TRT01AN, so the guard is false and the rule is executed and silent -- even though the degraded key would collapse the table into one group and flag row 3. Requirements.Variables.All: [TRTxxA] is satisfied by TRT01A, which is why this is a silence and not a skip. Compare PMDA-AD0242-skipped_no_trt01an_column-ADSL.cdt: the same missing column, the opposite verdict, because for AD0242 that column is the All entry."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
dataset ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TRT01A  type=Char
---
S1 | 001 | DRUGX
S1 | 002 | DRUGX
S1 | 003 | DRUGY
